(6776754, 1016503, 41337, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Although the rendering comes across as a bit too derivative, due to the same sort of sculpting jmritz has used with a similar subject. As a result this one doesn''t quite stand on it''s own two feet, which IMO is still a requirement even in these "Style of" challenges.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Although the rendering comes across as a bit too derivative, due to the same sort of sculpting jmritz has used with a similar subject. As a result this one doesn''t quite stand on it''s own two feet, which IMO is still a requirement even in these "Style of" challenges.', '2012-05-23 15:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6776755, 1016171, 53147, '<td valign="top">I voted earlier this morning and came back to do some thumb nail cherry picking for comments. This one stood out. Very pleasing image to my eye. Love the overall texture and the smile of Molly brings an added emotional aspect to what was already a visually satisfying image. Bumping up 1.</td>', 'I voted earlier this morning and came back to do some thumb nail cherry picking for comments. This one stood out. Very pleasing image to my eye. Love the overall texture and the smile of Molly brings an added emotional aspect to what was already a visually satisfying image. Bumping up 1.', '2012-05-23 15:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
