(6778452, 1016962, 61396, '<td valign="top">puzzling (maybe a man sitting on a chair as seen from the back?) The grain and the yellow cast make me feel like this is a beach scene. I can sure believe this is a jmritz original.</td>', 'puzzling (maybe a man sitting on a chair as seen from the back?) The grain and the yellow cast make me feel like this is a beach scene. I can sure believe this is a jmritz original.', '2012-05-25 18:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6778456, 1016922, 61396, '<td valign="top">a nice combination of the <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=11769" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">jmritz</a> style with a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=54645" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bspurgeon</a> subject matter (not a bad combination one may add)</td>', 'a nice combination of the  jmritz style with a  bspurgeon subject matter (not a bad combination one may add)', '2012-05-25 18:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6778497, 1016620, 18367, '<td valign="top">I have no clue whatsoever as to what "In the style of:jmritz", but I do know that I really like this image.  The leading lines, the approaching subjects, the impression on gets that the image was taken from a car window during a rainstorm of monsoon proportions... all of these truly do appeal to me.<br/> <br/>Definitely the highest score I have ever given for an image of this type.  The very best of luck to you in the challenge, and here is hoping we see this on the front page.</td>', 'I have no clue whatsoever as to what "In the style of:jmritz", but I do know that I really like this image.  The leading lines, the approaching subjects, the impression on gets that the image was taken from a car window during a rainstorm of monsoon proportions... all of these truly do appeal to me. Definitely the highest score I have ever given for an image of this type.  The very best of luck to you in the challenge, and here is hoping we see this on the front page.', '2012-05-25 19:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
