(6779148, 1016248, 11769, '<td valign="top">Great imaginative shot, I see the hippo! The hippo is blowing bubbles!</td>', 'Great imaginative shot, I see the hippo! The hippo is blowing bubbles!', '2012-05-26 21:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779149, 1016306, 11769, '<td valign="top">That''s not polite. Cute. Love the feeling of nature, being in the wild.</td>', 'That''s not polite. Cute. Love the feeling of nature, being in the wild.', '2012-05-26 21:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779151, 1016112, 11769, '<td valign="top">Great photograph. The space between. Sensitive and beautiful.</td>', 'Great photograph. The space between. Sensitive and beautiful.', '2012-05-26 21:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779205, 1016283, 61396, '<td valign="top">what a grand exit</td>', 'what a grand exit', '2012-05-27 04:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779207, 1016886, 61396, '<td valign="top">I suspect this is as cheerful as jmritz is inside</td>', 'I suspect this is as cheerful as jmritz is inside', '2012-05-27 04:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779208, 1016108, 61396, '<td valign="top">so not only your figures are conveniently located in opposite corners, and you have that vantage point that tells a little story, but you also have those triangles framing your image so nicely. what more can you ask?</td>', 'so not only your figures are conveniently located in opposite corners, and you have that vantage point that tells a little story, but you also have those triangles framing your image so nicely. what more can you ask?', '2012-05-27 04:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779210, 1016875, 61396, '<td valign="top">reflection, inversion, but an enigma still.</td>', 'reflection, inversion, but an enigma still.', '2012-05-27 04:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779222, 1015889, 53147, '<td valign="top">Cherry picking some thumbnails to comment on. Love the natural letterbox frame. Pleasant noise. Digging the yawn (straight face would have been much less). The hanging bags are a nice addition as well. Interesting image overall. Glad I came back to it to hang out on it a bit longer.</td>', 'Cherry picking some thumbnails to comment on. Love the natural letterbox frame. Pleasant noise. Digging the yawn (straight face would have been much less). The hanging bags are a nice addition as well. Interesting image overall. Glad I came back to it to hang out on it a bit longer.', '2012-05-27 06:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779223, 1016403, 53147, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6 on my first go around. Back to comment on it. Like the colors and the textures but I wish there was just something more, something to grab my eye or lead it somewhere. I enjoy a good noisy blurry image but I still want it to take me somewhere.</td>', 'I gave this a 6 on my first go around. Back to comment on it. Like the colors and the textures but I wish there was just something more, something to grab my eye or lead it somewhere. I enjoy a good noisy blurry image but I still want it to take me somewhere.', '2012-05-27 06:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779224, 1015948, 53147, '<td valign="top">Overall a pleasing image. Personally I would have probably pimped it out in edit to be a bit more contrasty. As is the colors are nice and the person (at least I think it is a person) in the image is a nice find. A little bit of dodge and burn may have made it a bit less flat and a bit more eyecatching. Granted, eye catching is not necessarily jmritz'' style, especially from an eye candy perspective, but I think this could have been a bit stronger. Gave it a 7 on my first vote around.</td>', 'Overall a pleasing image. Personally I would have probably pimped it out in edit to be a bit more contrasty. As is the colors are nice and the person (at least I think it is a person) in the image is a nice find. A little bit of dodge and burn may have made it a bit less flat and a bit more eyecatching. Granted, eye catching is not necessarily jmritz'' style, especially from an eye candy perspective, but I think this could have been a bit stronger. Gave it a 7 on my first vote around.', '2012-05-27 06:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779225, 1015981, 53147, '<td valign="top">Of the three images of this character, this one is by far the most entertaining (and the most creepy). My guess would be this is a SP of the man himself. The blur, noise and edit have that feel - and it is a good feel. Curious to see where this one lands.</td>', 'Of the three images of this character, this one is by far the most entertaining (and the most creepy). My guess would be this is a SP of the man himself. The blur, noise and edit have that feel - and it is a good feel. Curious to see where this one lands.', '2012-05-27 06:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779249, 1016886, 57447, '<td valign="top">I like the story this tells.</td>', 'I like the story this tells.', '2012-05-27 08:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779250, 1016404, 57447, '<td valign="top">I finally found it, my top pick.</td>', 'I finally found it, my top pick.', '2012-05-27 08:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
