(6781481, 1016403, 76335, '<td valign="top">Last night when I finished voting, I came back to try to comment on those that I consider "difficult" images -- i.e. images that I looked at and thought about for a long time but couldn''t find words for (maybe I''m the English <i>language</i> patient). It was late and I was tired. Words still wouldn''t come. It was the second time I contemplated this image, finding its churning blue both enchanting and unsettling at the same time. It was the last image I looked at before giving up and going to bed. I contemplated it in my dreams. Okay, maybe that''s going too far. I did have strange dreams though. <br/> <br/>Perhaps a piping hot dose of Yirga Cheffe is in order this morning... <br/></td>', 'Last night when I finished voting, I came back to try to comment on those that I consider "difficult" images -- i.e. images that I looked at and thought about for a long time but couldn''t find words for (maybe I''m the English language patient). It was late and I was tired. Words still wouldn''t come. It was the second time I contemplated this image, finding its churning blue both enchanting and unsettling at the same time. It was the last image I looked at before giving up and going to bed. I contemplated it in my dreams. Okay, maybe that''s going too far. I did have strange dreams though.  Perhaps a piping hot dose of Yirga Cheffe is in order this morning... ', '2012-05-30 09:01:16.000000', NULL, 0),
